    <bpmn:process id="W_W4790" name="W4790. Host-Revenue Settlement, CPO Recon &amp; Financial Close" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly settlement; financial close (VS-17); CPO revenue-share recon
Frequency: Monthly + period close
Volume: ~monthly settlements across the network
Owner: Finance (VS-17/VS-80) / EV Program
Participants: Finance (VS-17), Treasury (VS-18), CPO, Legal (VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W4790 — Host-Revenue Settlement, CPO Recon &amp; Financial Close</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4790_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4790_Lane1" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4790_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4790_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4790_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4790_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4790_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4790_Start3" name="Monthly settlement; financial close (VS-17); CPO revenue-share recon">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4790_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4790_Task4" name="Settle host revenue: for own-operate, reconcile charging revenue (W4783) to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Settle host revenue: for own-operate, reconcile charging revenue (W4783) to metering (VS-115) and bank settlement (VS-80); for host-partner, reconcile the CPO revenue-share/lease settlement per the contract (W4770/W4772); manage CDR-based roaming settlements (W4782)
Responsible (R): Finance / Treasury / EV Program
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4790_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4790_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4790_Task5" name="Reconcile and post: match revenue to sessions/metering, allocate costs (energy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Reconcile and post: match revenue to sessions/metering, allocate costs (energy W4775, demand-charge, maintenance, insurance, capex amortization) per the unit economics (W4772), recognize revenue per PFRS 15 (VS-157) or lease accounting (VS-148), and post to GL (VS-17) with correct intercompany (VS-72)
Responsible (R): Finance / Treasury
Accountable (A): Finance Controller / CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4790_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4790_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4790_Task6" name="Manage exceptions and disputes: failed/reconciled CDRs (W4782), CPO settlement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage exceptions and disputes: failed/reconciled CDRs (W4782), CPO settlement disputes, unreconciled variances (links VS-118 revenue assurance), and the period close (VS-17); feed financial performance to analytics (W4792)
Responsible (R): Finance / EV Program
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4790_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4790_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4790_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4790_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-140 (ensure EV-charging uptime &amp; tariff compliance.) | - CTL-721: revenue reconciled to metering/sessions; PFRS 15/lease accounting applied; intercompany allocated; variances investigated
Owner: Finance (VS-17/VS-80) / EV Program</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
