    <bpmn:process id="W_W4791" name="W4791. Charging Compliance Audit — DOE/LGU/RA 11697/RA 7394 &amp; Cyber/Privacy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual audit cycle; regulatory inspection; incident (W4787); compliance review
Frequency: Annual + on inspection/event
Volume: 1 compliance program across the network
Owner: Compliance (VS-22) / Internal Audit (VS-21) / EV Program
Participants: Internal Audit (VS-21), Compliance (VS-22), Legal (VS-100), Cyber (VS-27.3), Privacy (VS-91)
Source: workflow W4791 — Charging Compliance Audit — DOE/LGU/RA 11697/RA 7394 &amp; Cyber/Privacy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4791_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4791_Lane1" name="Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4791_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4791_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4791_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4791_Lane2" name="Audit">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4791_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4791_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4791_Start4" name="Annual audit cycle; regulatory inspection; incident (W4787); compliance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4791_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4791_Task5" name="Maintain and audit the compliance map: electrical (Philippine Electrical Code)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain and audit the compliance map: electrical (Philippine Electrical Code) inspection &amp; certification of EVSE, LGU installation permits (W4774), RA 11697 charging-infrastructure mandates, Consumer Act (RA 7394) tariff transparency/price-tag display (W469/VS-151), PWD accessibility (RA 7277/BP 344, W4788), metering accuracy (VS-115), and BIR invoicing (VS-79)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Audit / EV Program
Accountable (A): Compliance Lead / EV Program Manager
Duration: Annual + on inspection</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4791_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4791_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4791_Task6" name="Audit the cyber/privacy posture: OCPP security profile &amp; network segmentation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Audit the cyber/privacy posture: OCPP security profile &amp; network segmentation (VS-27.3), session/driver-data classification &amp; consent (VS-91/VS-88), CPO/vendor TPRM (VS-161), and breach readiness; assure via Internal Audit (VS-21 W331 ITGC/W359 AI/data-ethics pattern)
Responsible (R): Audit / Cyber / Privacy / TPRM
Accountable (A): Compliance Lead / CIO/DPO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4791_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4791_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4791_Task7" name="Manage regulator interactions and findings: DOE/LGU/BFP inspections, Consumer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage regulator interactions and findings: DOE/LGU/BFP inspections, Consumer Act complaints (W469), audit findings &amp; CAPA (VS-21 W333), and officer-awareness of personal liability; maintain records (VS-88) and report to the board/audit committee (VS-36)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal / Audit
Accountable (A): Compliance Lead / Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4791_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4791_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4791_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4791_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-140 (ensure EV-charging uptime &amp; tariff compliance.) | - CTL-721: DOE/electrical/LGU/RA 11697/RA 7394/PWD/metering/BIR compliance audited annually; cyber/privacy posture assured; findings CAPA-tracked
Owner: Compliance (VS-22) / Internal Audit (VS-21) / EV Program</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
