    <bpmn:process id="W_W4792" name="W4792. Network Analytics, Utilization &amp; Decarbonization Impact Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly review; annual strategy/capex (W4769/W4776); ESG reporting (VS-25)
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly + annual
Volume: 1 group analytics view
Owner: EV Program Manager / Analytics (VS-28)
Participants: Finance (VS-17.4), ESG (VS-25), Marketing (VS-14), Store Ops (VS-07)
Source: workflow W4792 — Network Analytics, Utilization &amp; Decarbonization Impact Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4792_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4792_Lane1" name="Analytics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4792_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4792_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4792_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4792_Lane2" name="ESG">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4792_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4792_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4792_Start4" name="Monthly/quarterly review; annual strategy/capex (W4769/W4776); ESG reporting (VS-25)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4792_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4792_Task5" name="Track network performance: ports live, availability/uptime (W4789), utilization…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Track network performance: ports live, availability/uptime (W4789), utilization (sessions/port/day, kWh), session-success, revenue/host-revenue (W4790), cost per kWh, margin, basket-uplift (POS VS-08/VS-10 attributed to charging dwell), and customer NPS (VS-13); benchmark across sites/regions
Responsible (R): Analytics / Finance / EV Program
Accountable (A): EV Program Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4792_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4792_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4792_Task6" name="Track decarbonization impact: kWh delivered, renewable fraction (own solar…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Track decarbonization impact: kWh delivered, renewable fraction (own solar W4780), tCO₂e enabled (displaced fuel), and contribution to BuildRight&#x27;s Scope 1/2/3 + customer-Scope-3 reporting (VS-25); validate the green-attribution (W4780) to avoid double-counting
Responsible (R): ESG / Analytics / Energy
Accountable (A): ESG Lead / EV Program Manager
Duration: Monthly/quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4792_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4792_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4792_Task7" name="Report to leadership quarterly and feed the annual strategy/capex case…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Report to leadership quarterly and feed the annual strategy/capex case (W4769/W4776): reallocate capex from under- to over-performing sites, adjust own-operate/host mix, drive continuous improvement (VS-133), and report decarbonization impact to the board/ESG stakeholders (VS-25/VS-36)
Responsible (R): Analytics / EV Program / Strategy
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4792_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4792_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4792_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4792_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-721 (ensure controlled execution — Operations, Maintenance, Compliance &amp; Network Analytics (PA-163.3).) | - CTL-721: network performance + basket-uplift + decarbonization reported; green-attribution validated; outcomes feed strategy/capex/improvement
Owner: EV Program Manager / Analytics (VS-28)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
